# Images deployed on Minikube (step 2.0c, D5): built by .github/workflows/images.yml, pulled from GHCR by digest.
# Update after an images run: copy the digests from the run summary, open a PR. CI checks that
# infra/k8s/kustomization.yaml (images:) uses the same digests (tests/unit/test_manifests.py).
# Read by the Makefile (SparkApplications, landing pod); kustomize has its own copy for HMS and bucket-init.
